{"item":{"key":"moment:2933713","id":"2933713","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"379381","name":"肥肥重工","avatar":"4dccc5172ed3309dbc504428"},"time":1665676800000,"text":"家里收藏着三把神兵。\n第一把，霜之哀伤，阿尔萨斯凭此号令千军万马，君临冰冠冰川。\n第二把，龙一文字，源氏以之征战花村无往不利，纵横国王大道。\n第三把，1001激光2.0龙蕉伞，[at uid=179922]@1001Project[/at] 用它霸凌图哥，执掌HJM生杀大权。\n而现在激光龙蕉伞正在好评热卖中，特别是透明款，拿着它，即使不下雨，收着伞走在大街上，也可以是十里八乡最靓的仔！[emot=acfun,1679/]\n不要998，不要198，只要100.1，这把又酷又炫的龙蕉伞就可以带回家！[emot=acfun,1678/]","title":"","images":["b9060cedfa671eb4bb4571fd","1a420bcdbecc0feb8a1c8562"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":11,"likeCount":17,"bananaCount":5,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/2933713","timePrecision":"day","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":8,"archivedRoots":5,"threads":{"749236306":{"pages":["comments/2933713/threads/749236306/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"749236306","root":"749236306","user":{"id":"772100","name":"heda喝大了","avatar":"33ca2bfeb120b82e8ba09a72"},"text":"这是要抽奖吗[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1667212035780,"floor":3,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"736542260":{"pages":["comments/2933713/threads/736542260/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"736542260","root":"736542260","user":{"id":"379381","name":"肥肥重工","avatar":"de5ba98fd3b6e33fb2cc9451"},"text":"另外不管做什么事都要确认好周围环境，小肥没有做好这一点，发生了很悲伤的事。[emot=acfun,1748/]\n希望大家能引以为戒。[emot=acfun,1748/]","time":1665753455392,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}}},"commentPages":["comments/2933713/all/1.json"],"hotPages":[],"hotCount":0},"media":{"1a420bcdbecc0feb8a1c8562":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/379381_e8962c38796947ddbd2d802d9ac5be83.gif","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/379381_e8962c38796947ddbd2d802d9ac5b